<title>ZAIRE: SOCCER-ZAIRE AND LIBERIA DRAW 0-0 IN AFRICAN NATIONS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ZAIRE AND LIBERIA DRAW 0-0 IN AFRICAN NATIONS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>KINSHASA 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zaire and Liberia drew 0-0 in an</p>
<p>African Nations Cup soccer championship qualifying match on</p>
<p>Sunday.</p>
<p>Attendance: 75,000</p>
</text>
